---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import checks from '../../../../../public/equipment/06-08/verification.json';
import m from '../../../../../public/equipment/06-08/interactions.json';
import {frames} from '../../../../lib/equipment/06-08/solver.mjs';
const a='/equipment/06-08/',spec='https://www.fluigent.com/research/instruments/pressure-flow-controllers/flow-ez/',threeQuarter='https://www.fluigent.com/app/uploads/2022/01/flow-ez-no-bg-2.png',front='https://www.fluigent.com/app/uploads/2021/12/web_fez-2.png';
const display=x=>typeof x==='string'?x:Object.entries(x??{}).map(([k,v])=>k+': '+String(v)).join('; ');
---
<Layout pageTitle="Fluigent Flow EZ documentary view" subtitle="" description="Inspect an unconnected Flow EZ exterior and compare two fixed rectangles in a detached drawing." wide={true}>
<article id="fez" class="equipment"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/06-08/">← Equipment 06-08</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#fez-checks">Verification</a></nav>
<header><p class="eq-meta">06-08 / Fluigent Flow EZ / Documentary exterior</p><h2>Fluigent Flow EZ</h2><p>Inspect the unconnected exterior, then compare centered rectangles on a separate drawing. The roomy outline leaves 6 mm on each X side; the narrow outline extends 2 mm past each X side of the frame. Neither drawing represents an installation.</p></header>
<div class="e-grid"><section class="e-card"><h3>01 · Inspect the shell</h3><div id="fez-views" class="e-row">{['Bench','Front','Exterior','Desk'].map(k=><button type="button" data-view={k.toLowerCase()}>{k}</button>)}<button id="fez-xr" type="button" disabled>VR unavailable</button></div><canvas id="fez-model" aria-label="Orbitable standalone Flow EZ shell with detached diagram desk"></canvas><p id="fez-asset" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><p class="e-hint">The three detached desk keys pick the roomy, narrow and coincident drawings. The blue instrument has a blank static face and no actions. Drag to orbit, scroll or pinch to zoom.</p></section>
<section class="e-card"><h3>02 · Select a fixed drawing</h3><div class="e-fields"><label>Outline<select id="fez-frame">{Object.entries(frames).map(([k,v])=><option value={k}>{v.label}</option>)}</select></label></div><div class="e-row"><button id="fez-reset" type="button">Restore roomy</button><button id="fez-json" class="e-run" disabled>Export comparison JSON</button></div><p id="fez-status" role="status">No comparison.</p><p id="fez-result" role="status">No readout.</p></section></div>
<section class="e-card"><h3>03 · Read the centered outlines</h3><svg id="fez-diagram" viewBox="0 0 380 237" role="img" aria-label="A dark dashed inner 72 by 92 mm outline centered in a selected solid reference frame"><path d="M82 101H298M190 11V192" stroke="#98a8a5" stroke-width="1"/><rect id="fez-outline" x="124.06" y="20.93" width="131.88" height="160.14" rx="0" fill="#e7e8dc" stroke="#41696b" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="133.48" y="28.78" width="113.04" height="144.44" fill="none" stroke="#344552" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/><path id="fez-overhang" fill="none" stroke="#b55b40" stroke-width="7"/><text x="92" y="211" font-size="13" fill="#294c5c">Same scale; centered X/Z in millimetres</text></svg>
<p class="legend">Solid: selected frame. Dashed: same 72 × 92 mm inert outline. Red segments indicate X overhang. Signed per-side margin is half the dimension difference. Zero is coincident in this arithmetic model, not a physical tolerance. <a href={a+'example-comparison.json'}>Example JSON</a>.</p></section>
<section><h3>Documentary model and references</h3><div class="e-grid"><figure><img src={a+'original-front.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original Flow EZ silhouette with an independent drawing desk"/><figcaption>Original reconstruction guided by <a href={front}>Fluigent’s front product image</a>. The detached desk is invented.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src={a+'original-work.svg'} width="760" height="450" alt="Original standalone blue module with dead blank front and a fixed silver cap"/><figcaption>External proportions and finish follow the <a href={threeQuarter}>manufacturer’s three-quarter image</a>; front details are static, and connection hardware is not modeled.</figcaption></figure></div>
<div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Quantity</th><th>Manufacturer</th><th>Model check</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Width × depth × height</td><td><a href={spec}>71.8 × 91.9 × 131 mm</a>, hardware envelope reordered from L × W × H</td><td>71.8 × 91.9 × 131 mm, parsed from metric node/accessor bounds; not a physical measurement.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p>No device state, connection, settings, pressure or flow are modeled. The drawing does not receive an instrument or a specimen. The register’s hydraulic-control acceptance is outside the scope of this documentary pass.</p></section>
<section id="fez-checks"><h3>Verification and files</h3><div class="e-over"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>{checks.map(x=><tr><td>{x.id}</td><td>{display(x.expected)}</td><td>{display(x.actual)}</td><td>{x.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<p><a href={a+'reference-plan.json'}>Predeclared cases</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Verification data</a> · <a href={a+'fluigent-flow-ez.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'geometry-source.mjs'}>Editable geometry</a> + <a href={a+'make-model.mjs'}>generator</a> + <a href={a+'mesh-writer.mjs'}>mesh writer</a> · <a href={a+'interactions.json'}>Named targets</a>. {m.triangles.toLocaleString()} triangles and {m.draws} draw primitives; optional WebXR, physical headset untested.</p></section></article></Layout>
<script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/06-08/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
#fez header{max-width:73ch;padding:1.3rem 0}#fez h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,6vw,4rem);margin:.2rem 0}#fez section{margin:1rem 0}.e-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1rem}.e-card{border:1px solid var(--border);padding:.8rem;min-width:0}.e-card h3{margin:.3rem 0}.e-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.4rem;margin:.5rem 0}.e-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.55rem}.e-fields label{display:grid;gap:.2rem}.e-fields input,#fez button{min-width:0;min-height:2.45rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:3px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--text);font:inherit;padding:.3rem .5rem;box-sizing:border-box}#fez button:disabled{opacity:.52}.e-run{background:#3d596e!important;color:white!important}#fez-model{width:100%;height:clamp(280px,34vw,440px);display:block;background:#ebe8e0;touch-action:none}#fez-chart{width:100%;max-height:16rem}.e-over{overflow:auto}#fez table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.85rem}#fez td,#fez th{text-align:left;padding:.45rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}#fez figure{margin:0}#fez img{width:100%;height:auto}@media(max-width:820px){.e-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.e-fields{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}
#fez caption{text-align:left}#fez input,#fez select,#fez button{min-width:0}#fez .e-hint{font-size:.92rem}#fez-diagram{width:min(100%,34rem);display:block;height:auto;background:#edeae0}#fez .legend{font-size:.88rem}</style>
